IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa30-sch11a`

-- coa30-tests-sch11a.l4: tests for coa30-sch11a.l4 (Schedule 11A). Each paragraph of Parts 1 and 2 is one constructor and
-- one assertion: the paragraph names the person or description, so the answer is JUST TRUE (decided from the paragraph).
-- A person or purpose that no paragraph names answers NOTHING (the list is not closed in its own words).

§ `Tests: Schedule 11A`

